 meningitis in the newborn piglet</article-title><source>Biol Neonate</source><year>1999</year><volume>75</volume><fpage>377</fpage><lpage>387</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10325441</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B17"><label>17</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Duke</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Neonatal pneumonia in developing countries</article-title><source>Arch Dis Child Fetal Neonatal Ed</source><year>2005</year><volume>90</volume><fpage>211</fpage><lpage>219</lpage></element-citation></ref><ref id="B18"><label>18</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Arnold</surname><given-names>JH</given-names></name><name><surname>Thompson</surname><given-names>JE</given-names></name><name><surname>Benjamin</surname><given-names>PK</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Respiratory deadspace measurements in neonates during extracorporeal membrane oxygenation</article-title><source>Crit Care Med</source><year>1993</year><volume>21</volume><fpage>1895</fpage><lpage>1900</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8252895</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B19"><label>19</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gerlach</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Rossaint</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Pappert</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Falke</surname><given-names>KJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Time-course and dose-response of nitric oxide inhalation for systemic oxygenation and pulmonary hypertension in patients with adult respiratory distress syndrome</article-title><source>Eur J Clin Invest</source><year>1993</year><volume>23</volume><fpage>499</fpage><lpage>502</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8405003</pub